{"seq":2,"slug":"overseas-warehouse-firstmile","title":"海外仓头程补货入仓","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/fba-warehouse-inbound/overseas-warehouse-firstmile","wordCount":2116,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"海外仓头程补货入仓\">海外仓头程补货入仓</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>第三方海外仓（Overseas Warehouse）是卖家在目的国自建或租用的仓库，它在头程链路里扮演两个角色：<strong>作为补货终点</strong>（货直接发到海外仓，由海外仓完成尾程配送），以及<strong>作为平台仓的缓冲</strong>（货先到海外仓暂存，按需分批送入 FBA）。第二个角色是海外仓在头程管理上最有价值的地方——它把一个&quot;必须恰好赶上 FBA 入仓窗口&quot;的刚性约束，解耦成了&quot;先把货运到目的国&quot;与&quot;按节奏送入平台仓&quot;两段可独立优化的过程。</p>\n<p>这个解耦的机制性理由在于<strong>两类仓库的弹性完全不同</strong>。FBA 的收货是刚性的：预约有排期、货件与实货必须一致、窗口错过就得重来；而第三方海外仓的收货是弹性的：可以随到随收、可以长期存放、可以按卖家的销售节奏分批出库。因此当 FBA 的预约窗口与船期对不上时（即 <a href=\"fba-shipment-inbound-appointment\">FBA 入库货件与预约</a> 里 <code>slack_days</code> 为负的情形），把货先送海外仓是标准解法。</p>\n<p>在系统里，海外仓头程的建模与 FBA 头程有一处根本差别：<strong>它没有&quot;货件&quot;这个平台强加的对象</strong>，取而代之的是仓库自己的<strong>入库单（Inbound Order / ASN）</strong>。这个差别使得海外仓头程的字段设计更自由，但也更容易失控——因为平台仓帮你定义了一套标准，而第三方仓各有一套，系统必须做适配层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[头程到港] --&gt; B{目的地是?}&#10;  B --&gt;|FBA| C[清关 + 提柜]&#10;  B --&gt;|海外仓| D[清关 + 提柜]&#10;  C --&gt; E{预约是否就绪?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[直送 FBA]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[转入海外仓暂存]&#10;  D --&gt; H[海外仓收货 ASN]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[上架为可售库存]&#10;  I --&gt; J{补货策略触发?}&#10;  J --&gt;|FBA 低库存| K[生成 FBA 补货计划]&#10;  K --&gt; L[海外仓拣货出库]&#10;  L --&gt; M[送往 FBA - 本地短驳]&#10;  J --&gt;|直接履约| N[尾程配送至消费者]\">graph TD\n  A[头程到港] --&gt; B{目的地是?}\n  B --&gt;|FBA| C[清关 + 提柜]\n  B --&gt;|海外仓| D[清关 + 提柜]\n  C --&gt; E{预约是否就绪?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[直送 FBA]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[转入海外仓暂存]\n  D --&gt; H[海外仓收货 ASN]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[上架为可售库存]\n  I --&gt; J{补货策略触发?}\n  J --&gt;|FBA 低库存| K[生成 FBA 补货计划]\n  K --&gt; L[海外仓拣货出库]\n  L --&gt; M[送往 FBA - 本地短驳]\n  J --&gt;|直接履约| N[尾程配送至消费者]</pre><h2 id=\"asn-与收货-海外仓的接口契约\">ASN 与收货：海外仓的接口契约</h2><p>海外仓收货的依据是 <strong>ASN（Advance Shipping Notice，预先发货通知）</strong>。ASN 与 FBA 的货件在功能上对应，但内容与格式因仓库而异。一个设计良好的 ASN 至少要能回答：这票货对应哪个入库单、由哪个头程渠道运来、包含哪些箱、每箱装了什么、预计何时到。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;asn&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;inbound_order_no&quot;: &quot;OWH-IN-2026-0927-014&quot;,&#10;    &quot;warehouse_code&quot;: &quot;USWEST-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source_shipment&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;firstmile_mode&quot;: &quot;sea_fcl&quot;,&#10;      &quot;container_no&quot;: &quot;EXAMPLE1234567&quot;,&#10;      &quot;bl_no&quot;: &quot;EXAMPLEB1234567&quot;,&#10;      &quot;eta_port&quot;: &quot;2026-10-14&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;cartons&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;carton_id&quot;: &quot;C-001&quot;,&#10;        &quot;skus&quot;: [{ &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;TEXTILE-A&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 40 }],&#10;        &quot;weight_kg&quot;: 16.0,&#10;        &quot;dimensions_cm&quot;: { &quot;l&quot;: 60, &quot;w&quot;: 40, &quot;h&quot;: 40 },&#10;        &quot;sscc&quot;: &quot;123456789012345675&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;expected_arrival&quot;: &quot;2026-10-18&quot;,&#10;    &quot;receiving_mode&quot;: &quot;appointment_and_dock&quot;,&#10;    &quot;status&quot;: &quot;in_transit&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"asn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inbound_order_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OWH-IN-2026-0927-014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"warehouse_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USWEST-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source_shipment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"firstmile_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sea_fcl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"container_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXAMPLE1234567\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"bl_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EXAMPLEB1234567\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"eta_port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-14\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cartons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"carton_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"skus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TEXTILE-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"dimensions_cm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"l\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"sscc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"123456789012345675\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expected_arrival\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-18\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"receiving_mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"appointment_and_dock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in_transit\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"箱标用-sscc-而不是平台标签\">箱标用 SSCC 而不是平台标签</h3><p>注意上例中 <code>sscc</code> 字段。海外仓没有 FBA 的 FNSKU 体系，它依赖<strong>国际通用的物流单元标识</strong>。GS1 定义的 SSCC（Serial Shipping Container Code）是一个 <strong>18 位纯数字</strong>标识，由扩展位、GS1 公司前缀、序列参考与校验位组成，用于标识物流单元（托盘、箱等），通常编码为 GS1-128 条码或 RFID（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Serial_Shipping_Container_Code\">GS1 SSCC</a>）。</p>\n<p>SSCC 与 FBA 的箱标是两套标识体系，服务不同对象：SSCC 标识&quot;这个物流单元&quot;，而 FBA 箱标标识&quot;这个货件里的第几箱&quot;。一个卖家同时用 FBA 和海外仓时，箱子可能同时贴两种标签——这不矛盾，但系统必须明确<strong>在哪个场景读哪种标签</strong>，否则收货时会扫错码导致对不上账。</p>\n<h3 id=\"asn-与实际收货差异的处理\">ASN 与实际收货差异的处理</h3><p>ASN 是&quot;预告&quot;，实际收货是&quot;事实&quot;，两者必然有差异（少收、多收、破损）。差异的处理流程应当区分<strong>原因在家还是在外</strong>：如果差异源于装箱环节（少装），属于卖家侧问题，需要回顾装箱扫描记录；如果源于运输环节（破损、丢失），属于头程承运人的责任，需要走索赔。把这一个字段拆成两类差异原因，是海外仓入库对账的关键设计——它能直接决定后续是内部改进还是对外索赔。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补货策略-从海外仓到-fba\">补货策略：从海外仓到 FBA</h2><p>海外仓作为缓冲的价值，体现在&quot;补货&quot;这个动作上。补货策略要回答两个问题：<strong>什么时候补</strong>（触发条件）和<strong>补多少</strong>（补货量）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发条件-可售天数阈值\">触发条件：可售天数阈值</h3><p>最常用也最有效的触发条件是<strong>可售天数（Days of Supply）</strong>——当前 FBA 可售库存除以日均销量。当可售天数低于阈值（如 30 天）时触发补货。这个阈值不是常数，它应当等于&quot;从海外仓发货到 FBA 上架可售&quot;的总时长加上安全余量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>trigger</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>pick</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fba_receive</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{trigger}} = T_{\\text{pick}} + T_{\\text{linehaul}} + T_{\\text{fba\\_receive}} + T_{\\text{safety}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trigger</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fba_receive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safety</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>pick</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{pick}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是海外仓拣货打包时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{linehaul}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是本地短驳时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>fba_receive</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{fba\\_receive}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fba_receive</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 FBA 收货到上架的时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{safety}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safety</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是安全余量。把阈值算出来而不是拍一个数，能避免&quot;阈值设太小导致断货、设太大导致 FBA 仓储费上升&quot;两类错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补货量-覆盖一个补货周期\">补货量：覆盖一个补货周期</h3><p>补货量应覆盖&quot;下一次补货到货&quot;之前的销量，即一个补货周期加上安全库存：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>daily</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>cycle</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>safety</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>inbound</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = D_{\\text{daily}} \\times (T_{\\text{cycle}} + T_{\\text{safety}}) - I_{\\text{inbound}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">daily</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safety</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inbound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>daily</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{daily}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">daily</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是日均销量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>cycle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{cycle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是补货周期（两次补货之间的间隔），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>inbound</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{inbound}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inbound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是已在途的补货量。减去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>inbound</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{inbound}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inbound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这一步最容易被漏掉，漏掉会导致<strong>重复补货</strong>——每一轮算出的量都是&quot;从零开始需要多少&quot;，而不是&quot;还差多少&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 海外仓到 FBA 的补货建议：可售天数低于阈值且考虑在途&#10;WITH sales AS (&#10;  SELECT sku,&#10;         SUM(qty)::numeric / 30 AS daily_sales&#10;  FROM order_lines&#10;  WHERE order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY sku&#10;),&#10;inventory AS (&#10;  SELECT sku,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN location = &#39;FBA_AVAILABLE&#39; THEN qty ELSE 0 END)      AS fba_avail,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN location = &#39;INBOUND_TO_FBA&#39; THEN qty ELSE 0 END)     AS inbound&#10;  FROM inventory_snapshot&#10;  GROUP BY sku&#10;)&#10;SELECT i.sku,&#10;       ROUND(i.fba_avail / NULLIF(s.daily_sales, 0), 1)          AS days_of_supply,&#10;       GREATEST(0, CEIL(s.daily_sales * 45 - i.inbound))::int    AS suggested_qty&#10;FROM inventory i&#10;JOIN sales s USING (sku)&#10;WHERE i.fba_avail / NULLIF(s.daily_sales, 0) &lt; 30;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 海外仓到 FBA 的补货建议：可售天数低于阈值且考虑在途</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_lines</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FBA_AVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fba_avail,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INBOUND_TO_FBA'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fba_avail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> days_of_supply,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CEIL(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_sales</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 45</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">inbound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suggested_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fba_avail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_sales</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"补货周期与头程节奏必须对齐\">补货周期与头程节奏必须对齐</h3><p>补货周期不应独立于头程节奏设定。如果海外仓的补货周期是 30 天，而海运头程到海外仓的周期是 45 天，那么海外仓的库存水位必须始终覆盖至少 45 天，否则会出现&quot;海外仓也没货、FBA 也没货&quot;的双断货。这类错配的根因是<strong>两个库存池的补货周期没有联合规划</strong>，正确的做法是把国内仓 → 海外仓 → FBA 当作一条多级库存链统一求解安全库存，而不是各自定各自的阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"海外仓与-fba-的库存分配\">海外仓与 FBA 的库存分配</h2><p>同时使用海外仓与 FBA 的卖家面临一个持续存在的分配问题：<strong>同一批货，多少进 FBA、多少留海外仓？</strong> 这个决策的输入是多维的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>倾向 FBA</th>\n<th>倾向海外仓</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品周转</td>\n<td>高周转、稳定销量</td>\n<td>低周转、波动大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台依赖</td>\n<td>单平台运营</td>\n<td>多平台/独立站</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效要求</td>\n<td>需要 Prime 标</td>\n<td>可接受较慢配送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本结构</td>\n<td>愿付 FBA 履约费</td>\n<td>想省履约费自配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存风险</td>\n<td>销量可预测</td>\n<td>滞销风险高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断的核心是<strong>滞销风险的承担位置</strong>。FBA 的长期仓储费随存放时长上升，滞销品留在 FBA 代价高；而海外仓的仓储费率通常更低、且可以灵活处理（退运、转售、销毁）。因此一个稳健的策略是把<strong>波动性大的新品的首次备货主要放在海外仓</strong>，等销量验证稳定后再批量补进 FBA。这本质上是把海外仓当作&quot;库存风险的缓冲区&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"转运的时效必须计入-fba-的补货提前期\">转运的时效必须计入 FBA 的补货提前期</h3><p>海外仓到 FBA 的短驳虽然地理距离短，但<strong>加上 FBA 的预约排队</strong>后，总时长可能并不短。因此计算 FBA 的可售天数阈值时，必须用&quot;短驳 + 预约排队 + 收货上架&quot;的完整时长，而不能只算短驳的运输时间。这是海外仓补货最常见的估算错误，也是导致&quot;明明设了 30 天阈值却还是断货&quot;的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>海外仓在头程里有两个角色：<strong>补货终点</strong>与<strong>平台仓缓冲</strong>；后者的价值在于把 FBA 刚性的入仓窗口解耦为&quot;运到目的国&quot;与&quot;按节奏送入 FBA&quot;两段。</li>\n<li>海外仓头程没有平台强加的&quot;货件&quot;，代之以仓库自己的 <strong>ASN</strong>；箱标通常用 GS1 <strong>SSCC</strong>（18 位纯数字：扩展位 + 公司前缀 + 序列参考 + 校验位），与 FBA 箱标是两套体系。</li>\n<li>ASN 与实际收货的差异必须区分原因在家（装箱少装）还是在途（破损丢失），它决定后续是内部改进还是对外索赔。</li>\n<li>补货触发阈值等于&quot;拣货 + 短驳 + FBA 收货上架 + 安全余量&quot;的总时长；补货量必须减去在途量，否则会重复补货。</li>\n<li>海外仓与 FBA 的库存分配核心是<strong>滞销风险放在哪里</strong>；新品首次备货宜放海外仓，验证销量后再批量进 FBA。</li>\n<li>海外仓到 FBA 的提前期必须包含预约排队时长，只算短驳运输时间是导致断货的常见估算错误。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"海外仓头程补货入仓","id":"海外仓头程补货入仓"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ASN 与收货：海外仓的接口契约","id":"asn-与收货-海外仓的接口契约"},{"level":3,"text":"箱标用 SSCC 而不是平台标签","id":"箱标用-sscc-而不是平台标签"},{"level":3,"text":"ASN 与实际收货差异的处理","id":"asn-与实际收货差异的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"补货策略：从海外仓到 FBA","id":"补货策略-从海外仓到-fba"},{"level":3,"text":"触发条件：可售天数阈值","id":"触发条件-可售天数阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"补货量：覆盖一个补货周期","id":"补货量-覆盖一个补货周期"},{"level":3,"text":"补货周期与头程节奏必须对齐","id":"补货周期与头程节奏必须对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"海外仓与 FBA 的库存分配","id":"海外仓与-fba-的库存分配"},{"level":3,"text":"转运的时效必须计入 FBA 的补货提前期","id":"转运的时效必须计入-fba-的补货提前期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FBA 入库货件与预约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/fba-warehouse-inbound/fba-shipment-inbound-appointment"},"next":{"title":"外箱标签与入仓合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/fba-warehouse-inbound/carton-label-compliance-inbound"}}